                    "# Luis Ordonez  \n**Software Engineer Full Stack | .NET Developer & Microservices Specialist | C# | IoT | Backend Engineer**  \n- **Management Level:** Specialist  \nSoftware engineer specializing in full-stack development and cloud deployment, with experience creating web applications using .NET, microservices, and Clean Architecture. I know about IoT and Linux. I have implemented efficient solutions for healthcare and human resource management sectors, improving response times, optimizing system performance, and upgrading legacy systems. Focused on clean development and best practices in development and security, I seek to contribute to innovative projects in agile and collaborative environments.\n### Software developer at Wayni - Tech & People · Lima, Perú (2022-04-01 – 2023-04-01)\n■ Web application development in .NET 6.0 implementing clean architecture and microservices. ■ Unit and functional testing using xUnit. ■ Architecture and database design.\n## Skills\narchitecture, development best practices, clean architecture, optimizing, best practices, human resource management, web apps, clean, software development, backup, apps development, web application development, migration, best practices development, database, software developer, cloud analyst, iot (internet of things), web apps development, software engineering, consultant, resource management, functional testing, human resources, .net, healthcare industry knowledge, agile, full-stack development, .net developer, systems management, web development, analyst, testing, maintenance, developer, .net 6.0, cloud computing, human resource, linux, engineer, database maintenance, application development, web applications, cloud software, collaboration, development, on-premise software/solutions, management, upgrading, software consultant",
